    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so is it mostly about the volume of those overtones? and i've heard people talk about \"ghost notes\" or weird unintended sounds in some instruments, does that have to do with the harmonic series too?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
